      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Slim 64px header with wordmark, active section, résumé, shared motion control and theme control.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Portfolio navigation preview\"><a class=\"ds-wordmark\" href=\"#home\">Thimira<span>.</span></a><div class=\"ds-nav-links\"><a href=\"#projects\" aria-current=\"location\">Work<span class=\"ds-nav-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a><a href=\"#about\">About</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"ds-nav-actions\"><a class=\"ds-resume\" href=\"#contact\">Résumé<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10M7 17 17 7\"/></svg></a><button class=\"ds-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Pause ambient animations\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Switch theme\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.9 13a9 9 0 0 1-9.9-9.9A9 9 0 1 0 20.9 13Z\"/></svg></button></div></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;min-height:64px;padding:0 20px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:12px;background:var(--page,#ece4d6);font:550 13px var(--body,Manrope,sans-serif);transition:background-color 220ms ease,border-color 220ms ease,box-shadow 220ms ease;}.ds-nav[data-scrolled=true]{background:var(--surface,#f5eee3);border-color:var(--line,#c7b9a3);box-shadow:0 12px 28px -22px rgb(0 0 0 / 35%);}.ds-nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;position:relative;color:var(--muted,#595346);text-decoration:none;transition:color 160ms ease;}.ds-nav .ds-wordmark{font:700 26px var(--display,'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif);letter-spacing:-.035em;color:var(--ink,#23231e);}.ds-wordmark span{color:var(--accent,#426015);}.ds-nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;}.ds-nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--accent,#426015);}.ds-nav-indicator{position:absolute;bottom:3px;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:var(--accent,#426015);}.ds-nav-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;}.ds-nav .ds-resume{gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink,#23231e);}.ds-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#595346);cursor:pointer;transition:color 160ms ease,background-color 160ms ease;}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--accent,#426015);}.ds-nav :is(a,button):focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#426015);outline-offset:4px;}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-icon:hover{background:var(--accent-soft,#e0e8c9);color:var(--accent,#426015);}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Filter",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter",
      "description": "A 44px selected filter exposing aria-pressed.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-filter\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{min-height:44px;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line,#c7b9a3);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#595346);font:600 13px var(--body,Manrope,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease,border-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease;}.ds-filter[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--action,#c4f464);border-color:var(--action,#c4f464);color:var(--on-action,#20251a);}.ds-filter:hover:not([aria-pressed=true]){background:var(--accent-soft,#e0e8c9);}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#426015);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "project-card",
      "description": "Selected project text region with a clear Problem / My contribution / Outcome definition list; the full page places its screenshot to the left on desktop.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-project\"><h3>NearU</h3><p class=\"ds-project-summary\">Real-time backend engineering</p><dl class=\"ds-project-facts\"><div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Helping students find a ride through a campus-focused platform.</dd></div><div><dt>My contribution</dt><dd>Backend and cloud engineering in a four-developer team.</dd></div><div class=\"ds-project-outcome\"><dt>Outcome</dt><dd>A working platform with a live demo.</dd></div></dl><a href=\"#projects\">Explore the work</a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-project{padding:36px;border:1px solid var(--line,#c7b9a3);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface,#f5eee3);color:var(--ink,#23231e);font:16px/1.7 var(--body,Manrope,sans-serif);transition:border-color 240ms ease;}.ds-project h3{margin:0 0 16px;font:600 38px/1.15 var(--display,'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif);letter-spacing:-.025em;}.ds-project-summary{margin:0 0 24px;}.ds-project-facts{display:grid;gap:16px;margin:0 0 24px;}.ds-project-facts>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:112px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;}.ds-project-facts dt{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.75;}.ds-project-facts dd{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted,#595346);}.ds-project-outcome{padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#c7b9a3);}.ds-project-outcome dt,.ds-project-outcome dd{color:var(--positive,#446023);}.ds-project a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:var(--accent,#426015);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-underline-offset:5px;}.ds-project a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#426015);outline-offset:4px;}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-project:hover{border-color:var(--sand,#8a6943);}.ds-project a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A little corner of my world",
    "overview": "A little corner of my world pairs a finished pixel workspace with a readable engineering portfolio. Ink black and warm sand carry the surfaces and typography; electric lime identifies actions and interaction states.\n\nThe interface uses tonal layers, restrained borders, expressive display type, and readable engineering detail. Motion introduces the work, gives the monitor and steam gentle activity, and carries sparse geometric accents at the page edges while reading content stays still after arrival.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Ink and sand surfaces with lime actions.",
      "Bricolage Grotesque display with Manrope reading and navigation type.",
      "Original grounded pixel artwork and sparse background graphics with shared pause controls.",
      "Adaptive layouts and a still reduced-motion composition."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Theme Pair Rule",
        "body": "Use the semantic CSS variables for surfaces and text so each foreground travels with its light or dark background.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Readable Type Rule",
        "body": "Pixel art belongs to the illustration; display headings use Bricolage Grotesque while reading text and navigation remain in Manrope.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Still Reading Rule",
        "body": "Reading content enters once and stays still; ongoing animation belongs to the pausable monitor, steam, and sparse background accents, while the desk remains grounded.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do pair semantic foreground and background variables in both themes.",
      "Do keep controls at least 44px high and form text at 16px.",
      "Do gate hover movement to fine pointers and honor reduced motion.",
      "Do retain the original artwork's transparency and provenance."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't use the pixel artwork's styling as a body-text font.",
      "Don't hide reading content behind a loader or replay entrances on every scroll.",
      "Don't run the artwork when paused, offscreen, in a hidden tab, or under reduced motion; the background shares pause, hidden-tab, and reduced-motion states."
    ]
  }
}
